    "paragraph": "Researchers built and deployed an interactive web framework that calculates individual-level urban accessibility scores based on user-defined preferences and walkability thresholds. Evaluated in Toulouse, France, an agent-based daily multimodal mobility model compared fifteen decision-making approaches against a real household travel survey. Additionally, energy cost stress tests were conducted on modelled income distributions for nearly one million properties across six English local authorities to map vulnerability under various price scenarios.",
